                  <photoshop:LayerName>This is NOT a valid temporary card. Once the California State P</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>This is NOT a valid temporary card. Once the California State Parks Division of Boating and Waterways has received your application, proof of education, and payment, you will receive a 90-day temporary boater card by email. You should receive your official boater card by mail within 60 days.</photoshop:LayerText>
